    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis spacious and bright ground floor apartment extends to approximately 925 sq. ft. and, while requiring refurbishment and modernisation throughout, offers an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to create a home tailored to their own tastes and requirements in one of Dublin's most sought-after residential locations.\n\nThe apartment, which requires refurbishment, offers the discerning purchaser an exciting opportunity on which to place your own stamp, in one of Dublin's most convenient and desirable locations, with an extensive choice of Dublin's amenities within a pleasant stroll. Just some of these amenities include the recreational facilities provided within Herbert Park's 36 acres, the excellent cafés, restaurants and specialty shops of Donnybrook and Ballsbridge, numerous sports clubs, such as Fitzwilliam LTC, Leinster Rugby's headquarters at the RDS and the Aviva stadium, to name but a few.\n\nMany of the city's corporate headquarters are also within walking distance, such as the South Docklands IT Hub, Merrion Square, Fitzwilliam Square and Ballsbridge. Dublin Airport is within a 20 minute drive via the port tunnel."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nA welcoming and spacious entrance hall, with generous proportions, provides plenty of space for storage.\n\nLiving room: - \nA charming reception room featuring elegant ceiling coving and pleasant views overlooking the communal gardens, creating a bright and welcoming living space.\n\nKitchen: - \nThe kitchen is fitted with built-in wall and floor presses, together with an integrated oven, hob, extractor fan and dishwasher. The walls are partially tiled, and the room enjoys a lovely outlook over the beautifully maintained gardens.\n\nMain Bedroom: - \nWith built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite: - \nWith bath/shower, w.c. and wash hand basin. tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nDouble bedroom with views over the gardens and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom: - \nWith shower, w.c. and wash hand basin, storage cabinet with washing machine and space for dryer, tiled walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E\nBER No: 108776667\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 310.84 kWh/(m2.y)"
      },
